Isn't it just cropped in half?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 No. Your landscape keeps the whole scene.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Most apps record vertical, then chop a strip out of the middle to fake a wide shot. You lose everything left and right, upscaled. ContentCam records the sensor's full 4:3 frame and cuts both formats from it. The landscape genuinely shows more of the scene, at full resolution.\
