Pricing\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Free to use. Premium when you want more.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The free tier is a real dual-format camera: 1080p, 30fps, front camera, three projects, no watermark. Premium adds Dual Lens (iPhone), Front & Back, photo mode, 4K, 60fps, manual controls, the teleprompter and timelapse.\
Premium comes as an 
\f1\b annual
\f0\b0  plan with a free trial, a rolling 
\f1\b monthly
\f0\b0  plan, or a one-off 
\f1\b lifetime
\f0\b0  purchase. Same features on all three. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///pricing/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 \strokec2 Full feature table 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 }}\
Private by design\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 It collects nothing.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 No account, no login, no analytics, no telemetry and no backend of our own. Apart from the store's own purchase check, ContentCam works offline, and it asks for exactly three permissions: 
\f1\b Camera
\f0\b0 , 
\f1\b Microphone
\f0\b0  and 
\f1\b Photo Library (add-only)
\f0\b0 . Your footage stays on your phone.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
