Quick answers\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 The usual questions\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Does recording both formats halve the quality?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 No. Both files encode independently in HEVC: portrait at 1080\'d71920 and landscape at 1920\'d71080, or 4K equivalents.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Which phones does it support?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 iPhone XS and later on iOS 18+. Dual Lens mode needs iPhone 11 or later. On Android, any phone with a capable camera. 4K and manual exposure depend on the hardware.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Is there a watermark?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Never, on any tier, free included.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
